{"id": "sdqa0004", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Khuzestan province, located in southeastern Iran along the Iraq i border, covers an area of approximately 35, 000 square kilometers. That' s roughly the size of New York State or about half the area of Ireland. It' s a significant region known for its oil resources and fertile lands near the Persian Gulf.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
