{"id": "sdqa0044", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Eleanor Ro osvelt led the writing of the Universal Declaration of Human Rights. She was chair ed the United Nations Commission on Human Rights that drafted it in 1948, and her leadership was central to its creation.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0052", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The biggest cricket competition is the ICC Cricket World Cup. It' s a global tournament where national teams from all over the world compete to be crowned the best in one-day international cr icket. The event attract s huge audiences, both live and on TV, and it's considered the most prestigious team championship in cricket.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0060", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "An organofo sphate is a chemical compound that contains phosphorus, oxygen, and carbon atoms. These compounds are often used in agriculture as pesti cides or insecticide s because they can disrupt the nervous systems of insects and other pests. However, some organo fos phates are also toxic to humans and animals if ingested or exposed to them in high concentrations. So while they' re useful for controlling pest s, they need to be handled carefully to avoid health risks.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0068", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "DuckTales first aired in 1 987. It was created by Carl B uchinsky and aired on Disney Ch annel, becoming a popular show that ran until 1 990.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0076", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The biggest diamond ever found is called the Cull inan Diamond. It' s a really huge stone that was discovered back in 1 905. The original rough diamond weighed over three thousand one hundred and seventy car ats, which is enormous! After it was cut into many smaller pieces, some of the most famous part s ended up being used in the British crown jewels. So, while there isn't just one single biggest diamond anymore, the Cullin an holds the title for the largest ever discovered.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 27, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0084", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Augustus became Roman Emperor in 27 BC. Before that, he had been a powerful leader known as Oct avius, and after a long struggle for power, the Senate granted him the title of Augustus, which marked the beginning of his rule over Rome.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0092", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The case Pacific Gas and Electric Company versus State Energy Resources Conservation and Development Commission went to the Supreme Court in 20 11.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0100", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Thermostats work by sensing the temperature in a room and turning heating or cooling systems on or off to keep it at your desired setting. They usually use a sensor like a thermo couple or bimetallic strip to detect changes, then send signals to control the HVAC system accordingly.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
