{"id": "sdqa0140", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "IMSI stands for International Mobile Subs iding Identity. It is a unique number assigned to each mobile device on a cellular network.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 7, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0148", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The first audio recording device was invented by Thomas Edison in 18 7 7. He created the phonograph, which used a cylinder covered with t infose to record and play back sound. This was a major breakthrough because it allowed people to capture and replay spoken words or music for the first time.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
